+ * navigation entry every 550 ms until the page has loaded, and waited
+ * forever. now() (and animation-frame and event timestamps) now count from
+ * this realm's start (macsurf_qjs.c), timeOrigin is that moment on the
+ * epoch clock, and one PerformanceNavigationTiming entry -- with
+ * performance.timing over it -- records the moments this page reaches:
+ * its response (the realm is made when the document starts to parse),
+ * interactive, DOMContentLoaded, complete and load. Network phases the
+ * engine does not measure read 0, as a browser's do when it may not tell. */
